@Groq_ApiKey = your_groq_api_key_here
@Local_Jwt_Token = your_valid_jwt_token_here
@Local_BaseUrl = https://localhost:5001

### 1. Test Groq Key Directly (Direct to Groq Servers)
POST https://api.groq.com/openai/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Groq_ApiKey}}

{
  "model": "llama-3.3-70b-versatile",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Reply with exactly 'Hello from Groq!'"
    }
  ]
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2. Test PharmaLink AI Assistant (Through your Backend)
### This will now use Groq as the primary provider (Priority 1).
### If Groq hits a Rate Limit (429), it will automatically fallback to TokenRouter, then OpenRouter, then Gemini.
POST {{Local_BaseUrl}}/api/v1/assistant/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Local_Jwt_Token}}

{
  "message": "What is Panadol used for?",
  "history": []
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3. Test PharmaLink AI Drug Info Endpoint
GET {{Local_BaseUrl}}/api/v1/assistant/drug-info?drugName=Panadol
Authorization: Bearer {{Local_Jwt_Token}}
